 "description": "<p>Nyhavn [209] is a&nbsp;former harbour site, located on the west side of Nyhavn at the south side of Kong Oscar Fjord. There are several buildings at the location. Most buildings are not usable.&nbsp;<a href=\"http://xsirius.dk/da/nanok.html\">Nanok </a>uses the \"Garage\"&nbsp;for storage of renovation material and&nbsp;provisions.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>Have a <a href=\"https://www.google.dk/maps/@72.2568849,-23.9232964,3a,90y,334.43h,106.73t/data=!3m7!1e1!3m5!1sAF1QipMF66S25VdQv67jI16oT9VsPSpWtilgWVFawEiL!2e10!3e11!7i5376!8i2688\">Street View of Nyhavn</a></p><p>For further information (in Danish) see also the Danish Geodata Agency:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.gronlandskehavnelods.dk/#HID=0ddbdbc2-467e-409b-88f7-dc847ddedaec\">Den grønlandske Havnelods</a></p>",
